{"id":"bu_squeda","lemma":"búsqueda","pos":"noun","rank":1195,"glosses":["search","quest"],"ipa":"/ˈbuskeda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"búsquedas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-b%C3%BAsqueda.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenemos una orden de búsqueda.","en":"We have a search warrant.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604987"},{"text":"Realizamos una búsqueda a fondo.","en":"We've made a thorough search.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804071"},{"text":"Creo que es una búsqueda inútil.","en":"I think it's a wild goose chase.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804150"},{"text":"Tom se debatió en búsqueda de su libertad.","en":"Tom struggled to get free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801399"},{"text":"Tom renunció a su búsqueda.","en":"Tom abandoned his search."}]}